title: "fracdirac: code and data for 'Memory-induced geometric coupling in the nonlinear fractional dynamics of laser-driven massive Dirac fermions'"
abstract: "Solver library (Caputo time stepping with L1 and second-order BDF2 convolution quadrature), verification suite, analysis and figure scripts, and the generated data and figures for the article 'Memory-induced geometric coupling in the nonlinear fractional dynamics of laser-driven massive Dirac fermions'."
